p08 : US Blanks 6'5"EPS (2010 catalog vector extraction; catalog volume unavailable)
p97 : This blank is designed for high performance short boards up to 20-1/4” in width. At 2-1/’2” thick it is perfectly suited for the hand shaper, and still works well for machine shapes due to the increased volume in the nose and tail.
